            "tender": {
                "id": "tender_311446/1174242",
                "title": "703708451 - The Provision of a Land Training Test and Reference Capability (LTT&RC)",
                "description": "The DPQQ and ITT processes have taken place. This is a publication of the Contract Documents for Transparency.\r\n\r\nOpportunity Listing: https://contracts.mod.uk/go/5134354101839E195DC3\r\n\r\nArmy HQ requires a Test and Reference Capability that will support the testing and integration of innovative technology and services for land individual, trade and collective training. This will be a three year contract with option years, delivered as a collaborative capability between Army and industry. The T&RC is envisaged to be an enduring capability, this initial phase will focus on establishing the processes and roles to support the development and delivery of the following three outputs:\r\n\r\n1. Management of GFX (Government Furnished assets, equipment and information) - Cataloguing and referencing the current training ecosystem.\r\n2. Test and Acceptance - Develop policy and processes for acceptance in be used by the Army.\r\n3. Engagement - To facilitate interactions between industry, the MoD and international partners. Building positive relationships.",
